          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellBorder" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Cell">시설 만족도(청결, 편의 등)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">□매우 불만족　□다소 불만족</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">□보통　□다소 만족　□매우 만족</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellBorder" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Cell">이용 만족도(사전, 사후 안내 등)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">□매우 불만족　□다소 불만족</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">□보통　□다소 만족　□매우 만족</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellBorder" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="Cell">추가 실시한 검사:</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Cell">　　 □없음　□성매개감염병검사　□풍진항체검사　□소변검사　□기타(　　　　　　　　　　　　　)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
